<h1>Claim your player profile</h1>

<p>
  <%= @inviter_name || "Your coach" %> recorded a player profile for you at
  Beach Volleyball Project and invited you to link it to your account.
</p>

<p>
  Sign in to the account you use, then open this link to request the claim:
</p>

<p><%= link_to "Claim my player profile", @claim_url %></p>

<p>Or paste this address into your browser:</p>

<p><%= @claim_url %></p>

<p>
  The link expires in <%= pluralize(@expires_in.inspect, "day") %> and can only
  be used once. The profile stays unlinked until a coach or administrator
  approves your request, so nothing changes before then.
</p>

<p>
  If you were not expecting this, you can ignore this email — the invitation
  expires on its own.
</p>